@startuml Member 도메인 테스트 코드 동작 방식 (시퀀스 다이어그램)

!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Member 도메인 테스트 코드 실행 시퀀스

== MemberServiceTest - 로그인 실패 테스트 ==

participant "테스트 메서드\n@Test" as Test
participant "MemberServiceTest" as TestClass
participant "Mock\nMemberRepository" as MockRepo
participant "MemberService\n(테스트 대상)" as Service
participant "Mock\nJwtService" as MockJwt

activate TestClass

Test -> TestClass: **Given (준비)**
note right
  val request = LoginRequest(...)
  every { memberRepository.findByEmail(...) } returns null
end note

TestClass -> MockRepo: Mock 동작 정의\n(every { } returns null)

Test -> TestClass: **When (실행)**
TestClass -> Service: login(request)
activate Service

Service -> MockRepo: findByEmail("notfound@example.com")
activate MockRepo
MockRepo --> Service: returns null
deactivate MockRepo

Service --> TestClass: throws BusinessException\n(USER_INVALID_CREDENTIAL)
deactivate Service

Test -> TestClass: **Then (검증)**
note right
  try-catch로 예외 캐치
  assertEquals(ErrorCode.USER_INVALID_CREDENTIAL)
end note

TestClass -> TestClass: assertEquals(...)\n검증 수행

deactivate TestClass

== MemberServiceTest - 리프레시 토큰 성공 테스트 ==

participant "테스트 메서드\n@Test" as Test2
participant "MemberServiceTest" as TestClass2
participant "Mock\nMemberRepository" as MockRepo2
participant "MemberService\n(테스트 대상)" as Service2
participant "Mock\nJwtService" as MockJwt2

activate TestClass2

Test2 -> TestClass2: **Given (준비)**
note right
  every { jwtService.validateToken(...) } returns true
  every { jwtService.getTokenTypeFromToken(...) } returns "refresh"
  every { memberRepository.findById(...) } returns member
  every { jwtService.generateAccessToken(...) } returns "new.access.token"
end note

TestClass2 -> MockJwt2: Mock 동작 정의\n(여러 개)
TestClass2 -> MockRepo2: Mock 동작 정의

Test2 -> TestClass2: **When (실행)**
TestClass2 -> Service2: refreshToken(refreshToken)
activate Service2

Service2 -> MockJwt2: validateToken(refreshToken)
activate MockJwt2
MockJwt2 --> Service2: returns true
deactivate MockJwt2

Service2 -> MockJwt2: getTokenTypeFromToken(refreshToken)
activate MockJwt2
MockJwt2 --> Service2: returns "refresh"
deactivate MockJwt2

Service2 -> MockJwt2: getMemberIdFromToken(refreshToken)
activate MockJwt2
MockJwt2 --> Service2: returns memberId
deactivate MockJwt2

Service2 -> MockRepo2: findById(memberId)
activate MockRepo2
MockRepo2 --> Service2: returns member
deactivate MockRepo2

Service2 -> MockJwt2: generateAccessToken(memberId, role)
activate MockJwt2
MockJwt2 --> Service2: returns "new.access.token"
deactivate MockJwt2

Service2 -> MockJwt2: generateRefreshToken(memberId, role)
activate MockJwt2
MockJwt2 --> Service2: returns "new.refresh.token"
deactivate MockJwt2

Service2 --> TestClass2: returns TokenPair\n(accessToken, refreshToken)
deactivate Service2

Test2 -> TestClass2: **Then (검증)**
note right
  assertNotNull(result)
  assertEquals("new.access.token", result.accessToken)
  assertEquals("new.refresh.token", result.refreshToken)
end note

TestClass2 -> TestClass2: assertNotNull(...)\nassertEquals(...)

deactivate TestClass2

== MemberControllerTest - 회원가입 테스트 ==

participant "테스트 메서드\n@Test" as Test3
participant "MemberControllerTest" as TestClass3
participant "MockMvc" as MockMvc
participant "MemberController\n(테스트 대상)" as Controller
participant "Mock\nMemberService" as MockService

activate TestClass3

Test3 -> TestClass3: **Given (준비)**
note right
  val request = SignupRequest(...)
  every { memberService.signup(request) } returns savedMember
end note

TestClass3 -> MockService: Mock 동작 정의

Test3 -> TestClass3: **When (실행)**
TestClass3 -> MockMvc: perform(POST /api/members/signup)
activate MockMvc

MockMvc -> Controller: POST /api/members/signup\n+ JSON Body
activate Controller

Controller -> MockService: signup(request)
activate MockService
MockService --> Controller: returns savedMember
deactivate MockService

Controller --> MockMvc: 201 Created\n+ JSON Response
deactivate Controller

MockMvc --> TestClass3: MockMvcResult
deactivate MockMvc

Test3 -> TestClass3: **Then (검증)**
note right
  .andExpect(status().isCreated)
  .andExpect(jsonPath("$.data.email").value("..."))
  .andExpect(jsonPath("$.data.nickname").value("..."))
end note

TestClass3 -> MockMvc: andExpect(...)\n응답 검증

deactivate TestClass3

@enduml
